{"abstract":"NMFS announces a public meeting of the Permanent Advisory Committee (PAC) to advise the U.S. Commissioners to the Commission for the Conservation and Management of Highly Migratory Fish Stocks in the Western and Central Pacific Ocean (WCPFC) on June 8, 2022. Meeting topics are provided under the SUPPLEMENTARY INFORMATION section of this notice.","action":"Notice of public meeting.","agencies":[{"id":54,"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/54","name":"Commerce Department","parent_id":null,"raw_name":"DEPARTMENT OF COMMERCE","slug":"commerce-department","url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/commerce-department"},{"id":361,"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/361","name":"National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration","parent_id":54,"raw_name":"National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration","slug":"national-oceanic-and-atmospheric-administration","url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/national-oceanic-and-atmospheric-administration"}],"body_html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/html/2022/04/01/2022-06901.html","cfr_references":[],"citation":"87 FR 19079","comment_url":null,"comments_close_on":null,"correction_of":null,"corrections":[],"dates":"The meeting of the PAC will be held via web conference on June 8, 2022, from 11 a.m. to 1 p.m. Hawaii Standard Time (HST) (or until business is concluded). Members of the public may submit written comments on meeting topics or materials; comments must be received by June 3, 2022.","disposition_notes":null,"docket_ids":["RTID 0648-XB907"],"dockets":[],"document_number":"2022-06901","effective_on":null,"end_page":19080,"executive_order_notes":null,"executive_order_number":null,"full_text_xml_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/xml/2022/04/01/2022-06901.xml","html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2022/04/01/2022-06901/permanent-advisory-committee-to-advise-the-us-commissioners-to-the-western-and-central-pacific","images":{},"images_metadata":{},"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/documents/2022-06901?publication_date=2022-04-01","mods_url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/metadata/granule/FR-2022-04-01/2022-06901/mods.xml","not_received_for_publication":null,"page_length":2,"page_views":{"count":73,"last_updated":"2026-10-23 08:15:04 -0400"},"pdf_url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2022-04-01/pdf/2022-06901.pdf","presidential_document_number":null,"proclamation_number":null,"public_inspection_pdf_url":"https://public-inspection.federalregister.gov/2022-06901.pdf?1648730728","publication_date":"2022-04-01","raw_text_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2022/04/01/2022-06901.txt","regulation_id_number_info":{},"regulation_id_numbers":[],"regulations_dot_gov_info":{"checked_regulationsdotgov_at":"2022-04-01T08:15:04Z"},"regulations_dot_gov_url":null,"significant":null,"signing_date":null,"start_page":19079,"subtype":null,"title":"Permanent Advisory Committee To Advise the U.S. Commissioners to the Western and Central Pacific Fisheries Commission; Meeting Announcement","toc_doc":"Permanent Advisory Committee to Advise the U.S. Commissioners to the Western and Central Pacific Fisheries Commission","toc_subject":"Meetings:\n","topics":[],"type":"Notice","volume":87}